sequenceDiagram
    participant HRIS as HR System ATS
    participant API as Onboarding Web API
    participant ONB as OnboardingService
    participant RULE as TaskTemplateRuleEngine
    participant DB as Azure SQL
    participant NOTE as NotificationService
    participant EMP as New Employee SPA
    participant BLOB as Blob Storage
    participant HR as HR Specialist
    HRIS->>API: POST /api/onboarding/offer-accepted
    API->>ONB: CreateFromAcceptedOffer(payload)
    ONB->>DB: Insert OnboardingRecord status Initiated
    ONB->>RULE: GenerateTasks(role, department, location)
    RULE->>DB: Insert OnboardingTasks from templates
    ONB->>NOTE: Queue welcome and task notifications
    NOTE-->>EMP: Email portal invitation
    EMP->>API: GET /api/portal/me (JWT)
    API-->>EMP: Tasks, documents, orientation content
    EMP->>API: POST /api/documents/upload
    API->>BLOB: Store encrypted document
    API->>DB: Save DocumentRecord status Submitted
    HR->>API: POST /api/documents/{id}/review approve or reject
    API->>DB: Update status and audit entry
    API->>NOTE: Notify employee of outcome
    NOTE-->>EMP: Resubmission or approval notice
    API->>DB: Recalculate completion percentage